# Normalises line endings to LF in the repository regardless of platform
# or a contributor's local core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a fresh
# checkout on Windows with core.autocrlf=true converts every text file to
# CRLF on disk, and `npm run format:check` (Prettier, LF by default) then
# reports ~all of them as "formatting issues" — a false positive with
# nothing actually wrong, confirmed during Phase 2 Milestone 6 by diffing
# the committed git blob (always clean LF) against the checked-out file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never go through line-ending normalisation.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
